   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Evidence",
     "texto": [
      "**Indiciu** is a fact that points to an explanation; **dovadă** supports a statement. They are not always enough to prove a conclusion."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Precision",
     "texto": [
      "**În consecință** introduces a derived conclusion; **precis** indicates that a formulation is exact."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
